<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="{{ csp }}"><title>{{ model.title }}</title><style>{{ stylesheet }}</style></head><body class="{{ theme }}"><main><header><div class="eyebrow">Strategy Reporting · 研究结论</div><h1>{{ view.strategy_id }} · 研究报告</h1><div class="muted">唯一研究范围：{{ view.run_ids|join('、') }}</div></header>
<section><h2>结论</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="muted">Research decision</div><div class="value bad">{{ view.decision }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">正式运行数</div><div class="value">{{ view.run_count }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">研究拓扑</div><div class="value">{{ model.protocol.topology }}</div></div></div>{% if view.partial %}<div class="notice"><strong>这是一份部分覆盖证据，不是原冻结全范围策略的复现。</strong> 本次范围为 {{ view.partial.instruments }}，{{ view.partial.start }} 至 {{ view.partial.end }}，{{ view.partial.frequency }}，共 {{ view.partial.total_rows }} 根 bars。</div>{% endif %}{% if view.is_s000012 %}<p class="muted">本页只陈述 S000012 的公开 structured source。{% if view.legacy_candidate %}{{ view.legacy_candidate }} 仅作为单一费用／保证金 profile 的来源标识，并非本次结果或可比较的 legacy 收益。{% endif %}S000017 未被纳入本报告的 run、指标或研究结论。</p>{% endif %}</section>
{% if view.partial %}<section><h2>数据范围与限制</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="muted">覆盖分类</div><div class="value">{{ view.partial.classification }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">品种数</div><div class="value">{{ view.partial.instruments_count }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">原始 bars</div><div class="value">{{ view.partial.total_rows }}</div></div></div>{% if view.partial.open_interest %}<p class="muted">持仓量：{{ view.partial.open_interest }}</p>{% endif %}<ul>{% for limitation in view.partial.limitations %}<li>{{ limitation }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>{% endif %}
<section><h2>证据门</h2><div class="grid">{% for gate in view.gate_results %}<div class="card"><div class="muted">{{ gate.label }}</div><div class="value {{ 'good' if gate.status == '通过' else 'bad' }}">{{ gate.status }}</div>{% if gate.failure %}<div class="muted">缺失／失败原因：{{ gate.failure }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section><h2>尚未评估</h2><div class="grid">{% for item in view.availability %}<div class="card"><div class="muted">{{ item.label }}</div><div class="value">{{ item.status }}</div><div class="muted">{{ item.reason }}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div><div class="notice">没有已发布证据时，OOS、稳健性、敏感性、压力测试与容量均不得由展示层推断。</div></section>
<section><h2>关联正式运行</h2>{% for link in model.related_formal_reports %}<div class="card"><strong>{{ link.workspace_run_id }}</strong> · {{ link.status }}</div>{% endfor %}</section><footer>研究页只消费 apex-research.study-report-source.v1，不解析 Markdown，不重建 engine metrics。</footer></main></body></html>
